  "notes": "Vite + TypeScript vanilla app on the official Bootstrap 5.3 default theme (no custom palette; dark mode via data-bs-theme). Icons default to Bootstrap Icons (nativeIcons=true); ?icon=/?icons=lucide|tabler|phosphor|heroicons switch to inline SVGs from the respective npm packages (75 semantic icons × 5 families; lucide lacks github/google and tabler lacks star-filled, so nearest glyphs are substituted). Fonts limited to the repo self-hosted OFL faces (Geist, Inter, Noto Sans SC, LXGW WenKai Screen) via ?font=. Native form widgets styled by Bootstrap (input type=range/color -> implemented; type=date/time -> composed). Composed from utilities/other components: DatePicker/TimePicker/DateRangePicker, Combobox/Autocomplete (<datalist>), MultiSelect, Rating, Cascader, Transfer, PinInput, DataGrid, Steps, Timeline, Tree, Calendar, Statistic, Descriptions, Segmented, Notification, Result, Popconfirm, CommandPalette (modal + list), Affix/BackTop/FloatButton, Sidebar/Layout, ScrollArea, Empty. Missing (no native or honest composition): Mention, QRCode, Resizable, Watermark, Tour. Known: single JS chunk >500 kB build warning (bootstrap + chart.js + 375 inline SVGs)."
